# Subproject-scoped ignore rules for continual_geometry.
#
# The parent monorepo's .gitignore has a blanket `results` rule that would
# swallow this subproject's results/ directory. That directory is our audit
# trail (LOG.md) and pre-registration evidence (mft_validity.json,
# cost_model.json, noise_floors.json) — it MUST be tracked. Re-include it,
# ANCHORED to this dir only (leading slash) so vendored third_party/**/results/
# stay ignored:
!/results/

# Per-arm Phase 1 records: thousands of files at the full grid, each carrying full
# loss curves and similarity matrices. The pooled `results/phase1_summary*.json` is
# the tracked artifact; per-arm files are regenerable with `run_phase1.py --resume`.
/results/phase1/
/results/corrected_lr/
/results/rank/
/results/isotropic/
/results/nottuned/
/results/scope/
/results/recurrence/
/results/adam/
/results/hamming/
/results/small_n_grid/
/results/unconfound_k3/
/results/width_g10_n40/
/results/width_smoke/
/results/shh_width/
/results/gamma_5/
/results/gamma_5_k8/
/results/gamma_5_n40/
/results/rank_one_arm_unnested/
/results/logs/
/results/*.log

# Human-only PDFs stay out of git (also enforced by papers/.gitignore).
papers/*.pdf
paper/harness/*.pdf
paper/harness/*.blg

# Local env / caches
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
*.egg-info/
dist/
build/
